From d7ff5c03dd5fd5ff2179131500272bc9c3d8ddff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: young <Young.Li@quantatw.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:51:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] soc: npcm4xx: skip ROM crypto self-test, add GPIOB0
 download hook

The ROM RNG self-test fails by chance (about 1 in 7300 power-ups) and
the ROM then halts in UART download mode. Add an OTP table with
oSkipCtyptoSelfTest set, so the ROM skips the self-test without
programming the OTP.

Add ROM hook 2 from the B0 demo: enter UART download mode when GPIOB0
is low at boot.

ImageGenerator: fill in the table SHA-256, hOtpImgHdrOffset,
hDevMode.hOTPRefToTable and the hook pointers, and fail if the table
is missing.
---
 .../common/ImageGenerator/ImageGenerator.py        | 65 +++++++++++----
 soc/arm/npcm4xx/common/header.c                    | 95 ++++++++++++++++------
 2 files changed, 115 insertions(+), 45 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soc/arm/npcm4xx/common/ImageGenerator/ImageGenerator.py b/soc/arm/npcm4xx/common/ImageGenerator/ImageGenerator.py
index ed4a9f68..cd220e1 100644
--- a/soc/arm/npcm4xx/common/ImageGenerator/ImageGenerator.py
+++ b/soc/arm/npcm4xx/common/ImageGenerator/ImageGenerator.py
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@
